lation of air. If the potatoes spoil, it is necessary to wait for some time after the bamboo covering has been removed before going down." "Even the poorest house with one room, stable, and thatch roof had a loft for the storage of faggots, straw, unthreshed grain, baskets of grain and miscellaneous articles, sometimes piles of grain and other foods."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 1704, 'temperature': 0.2})
